      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are in an immense amount of pain, and the pain has led you to see absolute stillness as the only relief. When sorrow becomes this overwhelming, the desire for finality can feel like the only true comfort available. If you are feeling this deeply overwhelmed, please know that there are people who can help carry this unbearable weight with you right now. Reaching out for immediate support is an act of strength, even when it feels like weakness.",
